{"4103180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kugle", "steam_appid": 4103180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity has no rules here.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kugle is a free-to-play multiplayer party game where gravity bends to your will. Jump between planets, race through warped tracks, and explore a handcrafted galaxy with friends, cross-platform on PC and mobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/01cff97d0f69c3a02c1d24f25974f48a.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/01cff97d0f69c3a02c1d24f25974f48a.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/01cff97d0f69c3a02c1d24f25974f48a.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect &amp; care for your Kugles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kugles are colorful little creatures, each with their own element, personality, and powers. Feed them, raise them in Goshi mode, and breed new ones with unique trait combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/63f2528092486fd2022cd73ecbf6b75b.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/63f2528092486fd2022cd73ecbf6b75b.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/63f2528092486fd2022cd73ecbf6b75b.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing:</strong> Fast-paced gravity races across wild planetary tracks. Find shortcuts, master each track, and fight for first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/dc94120a12108cc7a102e717b4bfeae7.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/dc94120a12108cc7a102e717b4bfeae7.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/dc94120a12108cc7a102e717b4bfeae7.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide'n'Seek:</strong> A chaotic game of tag against seeker Kugles. Get caught, and you become a seeker too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/9296d8b280f5aa83f178501c94e9a614.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/9296d8b280f5aa83f178501c94e9a614.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/9296d8b280f5aa83f178501c94e9a614.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Hunt:</strong> Explore giant maps filled with secrets and puzzles while gathering food for your Kugles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/082211b6639c42df86b7c91877640f90.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/082211b6639c42df86b7c91877640f90.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/082211b6639c42df86b7c91877640f90.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More coming:</strong> new modes and tracks every few months.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to be the first to play when Kugle launches this fall.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity has no rules here.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kugle is a free-to-play multiplayer party game where gravity bends to your will. Jump between planets, race through warped tracks, and explore a handcrafted galaxy with friends, cross-platform on PC and mobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/01cff97d0f69c3a02c1d24f25974f48a.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/01cff97d0f69c3a02c1d24f25974f48a.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/01cff97d0f69c3a02c1d24f25974f48a.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect &amp; care for your Kugles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kugles are colorful little creatures, each with their own element, personality, and powers. Feed them, raise them in Goshi mode, and breed new ones with unique trait combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/63f2528092486fd2022cd73ecbf6b75b.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/63f2528092486fd2022cd73ecbf6b75b.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/63f2528092486fd2022cd73ecbf6b75b.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing:</strong> Fast-paced gravity races across wild planetary tracks. Find shortcuts, master each track, and fight for first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/dc94120a12108cc7a102e717b4bfeae7.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/dc94120a12108cc7a102e717b4bfeae7.webm?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/dc94120a12108cc7a102e717b4bfeae7.mp4?t=1784152657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide'n'Seek:</strong> A chaotic game of tag against seeker Kugles. Get caught, and you become a seeker too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103180/extras/9296d8b280f5aa83f178501c94e9a614.poster.avif?t=1784152657\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\